<p>If you want to tick off many things and sights in one trip, this place is ideal. This mix-use development features high-rise condos, a mall, and a strip of restaurants that makes up for an interesting and far-from-boring jog time. The oval track where most runners go is relatively small but it’s still ideal for sprints and drill activities.</p>
